This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

Shard g of review-shard-merge runs units canon_merge, wv955 and bind956: the merge in place over mktemp worlds and STORY-BIND over a copy directory. The subjects resolve their siblings from their own path, and every mutant is skipped on a consumer anyway. A consumer runs the shipped shards a-d, which keep the located recorder hook, seal and wait-for-deliverable, and the arms that read the installed role, gate and QA files.
